      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t quite understand this change:\n\n- I think TPM  *should* reset if sys_rst or ec_rst is asserted.\n\n- how could h1 be possibly rebooting here: reboot_request_posted is never set, is it?",
      "revId": "16b0675481c26242925db43b44d5b4cadf99fccb",
