      "writtenOn": "2016-11-16T02:00:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand that these functions show when we assert those signals. My point is that TPM should/must be reset when these signals are asserted by h1.\n\nThis patch states that it prevents h1 reboots when write protection is enabled. I just fail to understand how this particular change is related: h1 was not rebooting before this change.",
