      "writtenOn": "2016-11-16T02:16:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, H1 was rebooting when this happened:\n\n       assert_ec_rst();\n       if (nvmem_setup(0) !\u003d EC_SUCCESS || tpm_reset() !\u003d 1)\n                system_reset(SYSTEM_RESET_HARD);\n\nBecause:\n\n1. assert_ec_rst() invoked tpm_reset() before nvmem_setup(0) completed.\n2. tpm_reset() returned -1 on occasion due to timeout\n3. This wasn\u0027t enough to prevent the watchdog from firing:\n\n\twatchdog_reload();\n\t_TPM_Init();\n\tif (!tpm_manufactured()) {\n\t\tTPM_Manufacture(1);\n\t\t_TPM_Init();\n\t\t_plat__SetNvAvail();\n\t\ttpm_endorse();",
