      "writtenOn": "2016-11-16T01:46:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The whole erase-nvmem \u0026 recreate certs process takes about 1.5 seconds. It turns out that we don\u0027t actually get an early return as long as everything is still working because the task priorities are high enough that this task (HOOKS) doesn\u0027t get a chance to run until the TPM task is done, so the evt value is 0x80000001 (timeout AND custom event) if it\u0027s only a second.\n\nI don\u0027t expect it to take this long, but I want something bad to happen if it doesn\u0027t complete (or start, for some reason). Otherwise, we\u0027re just assuming it will always work, no matter what.",
